[Ingredients:Batter]
When an ingredient lands in the bowl it is replaced by batter, which is drawn
in #COLOUR$46. The four frames are shown one after the other.

Sprite IDs #N$06, #N$07, #N$0A, #N$0B, #N$0F and #N$16 to #N$19 also point at
frame 1.
#UDGTABLE(default,centre,centre,centre,centre)
  { =h Frame 1 | =h Frame 2 | =h Frame 3 | =h Frame 4 }
  { #N$28 | #N$29 | #N$2A | #N$2B }
  { #SPRITE$28,attr=$46(batter-01-colour*)
    | #SPRITE$29,attr=$46(batter-02-colour*)
    | #SPRITE$2A,attr=$46(batter-03-colour*)
    | #SPRITE$2B,attr=$46(batter-04-colour*) }
UDGTABLE#

#FRAMES(batter-01-colour,50;batter-02-colour;
  batter-03-colour;batter-04-colour)(batter-colour)

[Ingredients:Cake]
The cake is built from five pieces, which are drawn side by side in
#COLOUR$46.
#UDGTABLE(default,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre)
  { =h Piece 1 | =h Piece 2 | =h Piece 3 | =h Piece 4 | =h Piece 5 }
  { #N$2C | #N$2D | #N$2E | #N$2F | #N$30 }
  { #SPRITE$2C,attr=$46(cake-01-colour) | #SPRITE$2D,attr=$46(cake-02-colour)
    | #SPRITE$2E,attr=$46(cake-03-colour) | #SPRITE$2F,attr=$46(cake-04-colour)
    | #SPRITE$30,attr=$46(cake-05-colour) }
UDGTABLE#

